OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStaying dry with plenty of
OL,6,Fstrong sunshine, although wispy high
OL,7,Fcloud may turn the sunshine hazier at
OL,8,Ftimes. Notably breezier than on
OL,9,FMonday, particularly on coasts. A much
OL,10,Fwarmer day though, especially inland.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPlenty of evening sunshine
OL,13,Fand then dry overnight with prolonged
OL,14,Fclear periods and variable cloud.
OL,15,FStaying rather warm in urban areas but
OL,16,Fcooler in the countryside by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
